((SELECT id FROM m), 'Specialties', 0, 'Fraffle Rarebit', 'French toast waffle, half-pound burger patty, jalapeño bacon, egg, hollandaise, and fried hash brown. The indentations provide a pocket of joy for your syrup.', '$15.99', 15.99, ARRAY[]::text[], 14),
((SELECT id FROM m), 'Specialties', 0, 'Create Your Own Skillet', 'Your choice of Country-Fried Steak, Prime Sirloin, Chorizo, Salmon, Sausage or Bacon. Country potatoes, diced red and green peppers, onions, two eggs the way you like them topped with shredded Cheddar Jack cheese and smothered in gravy.', '$13.99', 13.99, ARRAY[]::text[], 15),
((SELECT id FROM m), 'Specialties', 0, 'Eggs, Avocado & Toast', 'Two eggs the way you like them, avocado dusted with sea salt and your choice of toast and meat.', '$13.49', 13.49, ARRAY[]::text[], 16),
((SELECT id FROM m), 'Specialties', 0, 'Burnt Ends Benedict', 'A twist to the traditional Benedict. Burnt ends served on an English muffin topped with poached eggs and finished with our Alabama (white sauce) BBQ and served with hash browns.', '$15.99', 15.99, ARRAY[]::text[], 17),
((SELECT id FROM m), 'Specialties', 0, 'Eggs Benedict Flight', 'In this amazing masterpiece, you get our TRADITIONAL BENEDICT (Canadian bacon and hollandaise sauce), BURNT ENDS BENEDICT (burnt ends with our Alabama white BBQ sauce), and our new AVOCADO BENNY is smothered in our sun-dried tomato sauce. Guaranteed to please.', '$15.99', 15.99, ARRAY[]::text[], 18),
((SELECT id FROM m), 'Specialties', 0, 'Avocado Toast Flight', 'EGGS BENEDICT, BRUSCHETTA, CAPRESE & SALMON. We start with smashed avocado on all four as a base. The BRUSCHETTA has diced tomatoes, diced fresh mozzarella, minced garlic finished with fresh basil. CAPRESE is topped with sliced tomatoes, fresh mozzarella, balsamic glazed and sprinkled with fresh basil. SALMON has red onion and tried capers. EGGS BENEDICT starts with poached eggs smothered in hollandaise sauce and sprinkled with jalapeño bacon bits. Great as a breakfast appetizer.', '$15.99', 15.99, ARRAY[]::text[], 19),
((SELECT id FROM m), 'Classics', 1, 'Eggs Benedict', 'Half Order $8.49 | Full Order $13.99 | Two poached eggs and Canadian bacon over an English muffin smothered in hollandaise sauce. Served with hash browns | Substitute Salmon or Crab +$3.00 | Or make it a Florentine for a Vegetarian Option.', '$8.49/+', 8.49, ARRAY[]::text[], 20),
